🌍 Applications
Car parking assistance systems
Robotics obstacle detection
Industrial safety systems
Smart automation systems
🎯 Conclusion

This project demonstrates a practical embedded safety system that uses sensor data to provide real-time feedback. It is an efficient, low-cost solution for short-range obstacle detection and forms the foundation for advanced driver assistance systems.
